---
/** Packaged or bespoke: the two ways to buy. Used on the home page and both service hubs. */
interface Props { compact?: boolean }
const { compact = false } = Astro.props;
---
<div class:list={['grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2', compact ? '' : 'mt-12']} data-reveal="stagger">
  <div class="rounded-3xl border border-line bg-white/70 p-7">
    <p class="eyebrow">Option 1</p>
    <h3 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-bold">Packaged, fixed price</h3>
    <p class="mt-3 text-ink/70">Defined scope, defined team, defined price. The 10-Day AI Sprint and the two-week Opportunity Audit are priced on the site, start within a fortnight and end with a working result and a decision.</p>
    <a href="/services/ten-day-ai-sprint" class="mt-5 inline-block text-sm font-semibold underline decoration-signal underline-offset-4">See the 10-Day AI Sprint</a>
  </div>
  <div class="rounded-3xl border border-line bg-white/70 p-7">
    <p class="eyebrow">Option 2</p>
    <h3 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-bold">Bespoke, fixed price to scope</h3>
    <p class="mt-3 text-ink/70">Everything else we scope with you first, then quote as a fixed price for that scope. Milestone billing tied to demos, visible change control and no surprise invoices. Bigger platforms can run as a retained team if you prefer.</p>
    <a href="/contact" class="mt-5 inline-block text-sm font-semibold underline decoration-signal underline-offset-4">Scope a project with us</a>
  </div>
</div>
